  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Authored one class-22 pure-logic draft pc-contrast-01: it reads raw slots via inputs.get('slots') so absence is a valid invalid-result, validates that the list has length 1..3 and every item is an exact integer in 1..5 (rejecting bool, float, non-integers and out-of-range values), and assigns result = {'ok': valid, 'slots': original if valid else []} at module scope with no I/O, imports, host calls or exceptions. The draft is an unapproved target-interface component only; activation requires Q1/human Q2 and typed-runner support, which are not claimed.",
